+## Why Track B, and why it is parked
 
-This is not a Track A claim. Section 2 explicitly explains the reduction to
-\(x^q-x\), and a generic coordinate solver is exact Gaussian elimination in
-\(O(n^3)\) bit operations. At the shipping candidate `easy` (`n=59`), the
-eight-seed reference run solved 8/8 with 38,681 counted operations and roughly
